{"id":"00171","root":"uni00171_1","name":{"ja":"八津　紫","en":"Yatsu Murasaki"},"title":{"ja":"【剛力無双】","en":"【Peerless Strength】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【剛力無双】 八津　紫","en":"【Peerless Strength】 Yatsu Murasaki"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Undead","Taimanin"],"release":"2019-03-14","limited":false,"characterId":17,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍の一人。戦闘能力はアサギに次ぐと目されているクール美女。アサギが頭領を務める一派の下忍の出。兄は同じく対魔忍の八津九郎。政府によって設立された対魔忍養成学校・五車学園で教師も務める。ポストアサギ、次代の対魔忍隊長と将来を嘱望されている。アサギに憧れ以上の強い感情を抱いており、クールな彼女もアサギの前ではシドロモドロになる。理解されにくいが本当は優しい性格。ネコ好きだがネコに怖がられるのが悩み。異能系忍法【不死覚醒】は心臓と脳を同時に破壊されない限りどのようなダメージを受けても肉体を再生する。さらに、対魔忍トップクラスの怪力を誇り、巨大な斧を軽々と振り回す。","en":"(Yatsu Murasaki, she/her) A Taimanin and a cool beauty whose combat ability is considered second only to Asagi. She is a junior ninja under the faction led by Asagi. Her brother is the fellow Taimanin Yatsu Kuro. She also serves as a teacher at Gosha Academy, the Taimanin training school established by the government. Seen as the post-Asagi, she is expected to become the next Taimanin squad leader. She harbors feelings for Asagi that go beyond admiration, and even her cool demeanor turns flustered in Asagi's presence. Though hard to read, she is actually kind-hearted. She loves cats, but worries that they are scared of her. Her supernatural ninjutsu \"Undying Awakening\" lets her regenerate her body from any damage unless both heart and brain are destroyed simultaneously. In addition, she boasts top-class Taimanin strength, easily swinging a massive axe."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"水瀬沙季","forms":[{"id":"uni00171_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1236,2472],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[181,362],"def":[118,236],"spd":[48,48],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":41,"skills":["1","130004"]},{"id":"uni00171_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1872,3744],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[287,574],"def":[161,322],"spd":[48,48],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":41,"skills":["1","130004","130005"]